WEBVTT

NOTE R210 ORIGINAL SCRIPT PROPOSAL ONLY — VIDEO NOT RENDERED OR PLAYBACK-VALIDATED.
NOTE Time-coded captions must be checked against produced narration before any release.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
You've reached the bottom of a page.
But what was the paragraph about?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:15.000
In a reading experiment, researchers followed people's eyes.
They kept moving across words even while attention had gone elsewhere.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:23.000
That doesn't mean reading had continued.
It means the appearance of reading can outlast understanding.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:33.000
A different experiment tested three days of mindfulness instruction.
It did not test any commercial meditation recording.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Before paying for a twelve-minute promise,
look at what's in the recording—and what the research has actually measured.
